      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَدَوْلَى</span></b>  <i>An old, tall tree:</i> (K:) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَجَرٌ عَدَوْلِىٌّ</span></b> 
signifies <i>old trees;</i> one of which is termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَدَوْلِيَّةٌ</span>:
or, accord. to AHn, ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَدَوْلِىٌّ</span></b>  signifies anything
<i>old.</i> (TA.) ＝   
